cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this proof or the witness certificates, cite this archive and the works listed in README.md."
title: "Homogeneous cubic bent functions without affine derivatives outside the completed Maiorana–McFarland class"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For every even dimension at least ten, there exists a homogeneous cubic Boolean bent function with no affine derivative in a nonzero direction outside the completed Maiorana–McFarland class. Explicit verified seeds in dimensions 10 through 18 and closure under direct sums give the existence theorem. The result does not require indecomposable witnesses."
